# ── Sample audio: NOT distributed ────────────────────────────────────────────
# The kits/ folders reference one-shots sampled from commercial drum machines
# (Roland, Linn, Oberheim, Boss, …). Those recordings may be rights-encumbered,
# so no audio files are committed — only the kit.json manifests. Drop legally
# obtained samples into the folders locally and the kits become playable.
kits/**/*.wav
kits/**/*.WAV
kits/**/*.aif
kits/**/*.aiff
kits/**/*.mp3
kits/**/*.ogg
kits/**/*.flac
kits/**/*.zip
# kits generated locally from third-party sample collections (manifests too)
kits/local/

